# 2. Automated WhatsApp Notifications to Admin (via Free CallMeBot)
# To get your free API key in 30 seconds:
# 1. Add CallMeBot on WhatsApp: +34 644 57 88 56
# 2. Send message: "I allow callmebot to send me messages"
# 3. CallMeBot will reply with your API key (e.g. 123456)
